<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40927" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισπείρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sow with seed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.115
				</span></i>
			; <i>sow upon</i> or <i>among</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὰ ἄνδηρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.15.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>HP</u>
				7.5.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>CP</u>
					2.17.3
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. μομφὰν ἀλιτροῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					8.39
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφιστικὰ ζητήματα</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς ἐξηγήσεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					15.519
				</span></i>
			 (v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>sow again, with fresh seed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.17.10
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); <i>sow after</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζιζάνια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					13.25
				</span></i>
			.</div>
